;; DOTOS cell: permission, depth, description.
[
  {read trivial (|The answer is in one known place. You are fetching it, not finding it.|)}
  {read ordinary (|You know what you are looking for but not where it is.|)}
  {read demanding (|The answer is written nowhere. Assemble it from reading the parts.|)}
  {read critical (|Reading cannot settle it. A probe must be designed and run.|)}
  {write trivial (|The change is fully specified. No decisions remain.|)}
  {write ordinary (|The approach is known. Applying it is the work.|)}
  {write demanding (|The approach has to be chosen.|)}
  {write critical (|Several parts must change together, and a choice in one constrains the others.|)}
]
